  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fc5b65fe44baceeadf712e/step-a8d09600.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion. Grate carrot. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion and carrot until softened, 4-5 mins. Stir in Persian spice blend and remaining garlic, and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add lentils and cook until tender, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fc5b65fe44baceeadf712e/step-a7756310.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium and add coconut milk and the stock powder. Cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in baby spinach and the remaining butter. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fc5b65fe44baceeadf712e/step-5addd320.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop mint. In a small bowl, combine mint and yoghurt. Season to taste.\n• Divide garlic rice and lentils between plates.\n• Top with mint yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67fc5b65fe44baceeadf712e/step-5aff1730.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
